id: buddy-system
name: Buddy System
talentCategory: buddy
prerequisites: Personality Score of 4+
description: >
  You know better than anyone not to go anywhere alone.
text: >
  Buddy System: You know better than anyone not to go anywhere alone.
  –Prerequisites: Personality Score of 4+
  (1)-[Passive]: While you have an active Buddy, increase the Dice Score of your Steadfast Checks by 1.
  (2)-[Triggered/Start of Combat Encounter]: You may spend 1 Karma Point to gain a Buddy of your choice (you cannot choose a Special Buddy).

---

[passive]
# (1)
if (buddyActive) {
    steadfast.dice += 1;
}

# (2) As the Combat Encounter starts, ticked on its card - never Automatic, a Karma Point being spent: which Buddy asked among
# all but the Special ones, gained as from the Gear tab (its own questions asked), and the Karma Point paid once it is
# (chat.mjs buddySystem).
[triggered/start-of-encounter, chosen, effect 2]
requires karma >= 1;
buddySystem();
